{"3992720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Dejavu", "steam_appid": 3992720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/2346a78a428b1c3d2d9c716ea1235b69.poster.avif?t=1776602980\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/2346a78a428b1c3d2d9c716ea1235b69.webm?t=1776602980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/2346a78a428b1c3d2d9c716ea1235b69.mp4?t=1776602980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember the thrill of the arcade? The pulse-pounding challenge of a perfect run? *Project Dejavu* straps you into the driver's seat of a customizable toon tank and unleashes you into a world of vibrant, retro-fueled 3D platforming mayhem. This isn't just a trip down memory lane; it's a full-blown, high-octane reimagining of classic arcade action!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labyrinth Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a maze suspended over the ocean. Your mission is simple: find the path forward, avoid deadly drops, and escape from rival tanks who want to end your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/1a60a447f9bd5f986bdb016fa82d5aa2.avif?t=1776602980\" width=618 height=360 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Level Design</strong><br>Levels are built from familiar, repeating patterns of ramps and platforms. What starts simple quickly layers into trickier challenges, capturing the hypnotic rhythm of classic platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toon Tank Action</strong><br>Your tank may look lighthearted and cartoony, but the challenges are real. Face off against horde of  enemy tanks in stages that demand quick reflexes and smart movement. Spraying and praying also works time to time :).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/52693efa37a5a7982231cfc9045c1bb3.poster.avif?t=1776602980\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/52693efa37a5a7982231cfc9045c1bb3.webm?t=1776602980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/52693efa37a5a7982231cfc9045c1bb3.mp4?t=1776602980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Visuals </strong><br>Clean, bold, and colorful—the game’s look makes every hazard and pathway stand out, while keeping the focus squarely on the challenge at hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Progression</strong><br>With almost 50 stages built on remix-style repetition, every new challenge feels both familiar and fresh. It’s the kind of loop that recalls the arcade days—easy to pick up, tough to put down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love stylized platformers, arcade nostalgia, and playful twists on classic formulas, <strong>P</strong>roject <strong>D</strong>ejavu is ready to roll out the retro fun—tank style.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/2346a78a428b1c3d2d9c716ea1235b69.poster.avif?t=1776602980\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/2346a78a428b1c3d2d9c716ea1235b69.webm?t=1776602980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/2346a78a428b1c3d2d9c716ea1235b69.mp4?t=1776602980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember the thrill of the arcade? The pulse-pounding challenge of a perfect run? *Project Dejavu* straps you into the driver's seat of a customizable toon tank and unleashes you into a world of vibrant, retro-fueled 3D platforming mayhem. This isn't just a trip down memory lane; it's a full-blown, high-octane reimagining of classic arcade action!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labyrinth Platforming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is a maze suspended over the ocean. Your mission is simple: find the path forward, avoid deadly drops, and escape from rival tanks who want to end your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/1a60a447f9bd5f986bdb016fa82d5aa2.avif?t=1776602980\" width=618 height=360 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic Level Design</strong><br>Levels are built from familiar, repeating patterns of ramps and platforms. What starts simple quickly layers into trickier challenges, capturing the hypnotic rhythm of classic platformers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toon Tank Action</strong><br>Your tank may look lighthearted and cartoony, but the challenges are real. Face off against horde of  enemy tanks in stages that demand quick reflexes and smart movement. Spraying and praying also works time to time :).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/52693efa37a5a7982231cfc9045c1bb3.poster.avif?t=1776602980\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/52693efa37a5a7982231cfc9045c1bb3.webm?t=1776602980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/extras/52693efa37a5a7982231cfc9045c1bb3.mp4?t=1776602980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Visuals </strong><br>Clean, bold, and colorful—the game’s look makes every hazard and pathway stand out, while keeping the focus squarely on the challenge at hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Progression</strong><br>With almost 50 stages built on remix-style repetition, every new challenge feels both familiar and fresh. It’s the kind of loop that recalls the arcade days—easy to pick up, tough to put down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love stylized platformers, arcade nostalgia, and playful twists on classic formulas, <strong>P</strong>roject <strong>D</strong>ejavu is ready to roll out the retro fun—tank style.</p>", "short_description": "Blast, dodge, and drift through treacherous 3D mazes in a vibrant, retro-inspired tank platformer! Master twitch-action combat, survive bullet-hell showdowns, and uncover shortcuts to conquer nearly 50 challenging stages. One wrong move, and you're sunk!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/27cd301341e242e7fc43a80e78e3e4c706ad35b6/header.jpg?t=1776602980", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992720/c3346cfa7f3b982f98062aaed75df30b5a963ddc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776602980", "capsu